@startuml
title Skill State Diagram
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

state New
state Active

[*] --> New : AddSkillAsync() [all fields valid]
New --> Active : GetByNameAsync() [no duplicate]\n/ Activate(), AddAsync(), SaveChangesAsync()
New --> [*] : GetByNameAsync() [duplicate]\n/ reject 409 DUPLICATE_SKILL

Active -[#red]-> Active : <color:red>Activate() [already Active] / throw INVALID_TRANSITION</color>

note right of New
  Invalid input never creates a Skill (400).
end note

@enduml
